in this project will keep chart folder on one repo and also a cloud build.yaml file to package and push the helm package to gcp artifact registry. and values.yaml file will be on application repository and in application deployment cloudbuild.yaml file we will fetch the helm chart pushed from helm pipeline and also use the custom values.yaml file present in applicaton repo. to mantain the chart version we will update thechart version in helm repo chart.yaml file and same chart version will get use in applocation cloudbuild.yaml file to fetch the exact same chart version  on evry update in helm chart.
